te status).\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff can export the day's delivery list as a CSV containing order and address details needed by drivers.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Customer buyers and account managers cannot access the staff order queue or delivery export.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Staff get an order queue with filters, and a delivery list export for today's deliveries.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-7\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff dashboard shows counts/lists of new orders, orders awaiting confirmation, orders being picked, orders out for delivery, today's deliveries, and outstanding invoices.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff dashboard surfaces failed ERP stock imports so staff are aware of data issues.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff can view operational reports summarizing sales/product activity.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Customers cannot access staff/management reporting or dashboard.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Management (staff/admin) can view basic sales and product reporting via a dashboard/reports area.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-8\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Every order status transition is recorded with status, date/time, and the user or system that performed it, and this history is retained and viewable.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Invoice payment recording stores payment date and the user who recorded it, and this is retained.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Changes to customer accounts (e.g., price list assignment changes, address changes) are retained as history accessible to administrators.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n   