uct still works from historical order references even though it no longer appears in active catalogue browsing.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Only administrators can create/edit/retire products, categories, and compatibility data.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Catalogue system includes product data model, search, category filtering, and vehicle compatibility display, managed by admins.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-11\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Admin can create a new price list and name it.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Admin can add products to a price list and set/edit a single price per product.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Admin can remove a product from a price list.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Admin can assign a price list to a customer and change a customer's assigned price list at any time.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Admin can deactivate a price list.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Changing a customer's price list or editing prices only affects future orders; existing/placed orders retain their original order-time prices.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Only administrators can create/edit/assign/deactivate price lists; customers and staff cannot modify pricing.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A product missing from the customer's assigned price list is handled without crashing (e.g., hidden price or flagged) rather than showing incorrect price.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Each customer is assigned exactly one price list (one price per product per list), admin manages price lists and assignments.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-12\",\n    \"behaviours\": [